hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1730","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke un se Urwa ne Allah Taala key qaul (Aur agar tumhey khauf ho ke tum yateemon mein insaaf na karogey) key baarey mein poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae merey bhatijay! Ye yateem ladki hai jo apne wali ki parwarish mein hoti hai. Wo uskey maal mein shareek hoti hai. Aur usey uska maal aur uska husn achha lagta hai. To uska wali chaahta hai ke wo us se nikaah karey baghair iskey ke wo uskey mehar mein insaaf karey aur use utna dey jitna uskey siwa deta hai. To unhey mana kya gaya ke wo un se nikaah karein magar ye ke wo unkey liye insaaf karein aur unkey liye mehar mein unki buland sunnat tak pahunchein. To unhey hukm diya gaya ke wo un auraton mein se nikaah karein jo unhey pasand aaein unkey siwa. Aisha ne kaha: Aur logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se is aayat key baad fatwa poochha. To Allah ne naazil farmaya: (Aur wo tum se auraton key baarey mein fatwa poochhtey hain). Aisha ne kaha: Aur doosri aayat mein Allah Taala ka qaul (Aur tum chaaahtey ho ke un se nikaah karo) tum mein se kisi ki apni yateem se beraghbati jab wo kam maal aur husn wali ho. Unhon-ne kaha: To unhey mana kya gaya ke wo us se nikaah karein jiskey maal aur husn mein unhon-ne raghbat rakhi ho, yateem auraton mein, insaaf key siwa, unki un se beraghbati ki wajah se jab wo kam maal aur husn wali hon. (Bukhari: 4574). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Allah tumhey tumhaari aulaad mein wasiyat karta hai)."
"1731","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr ne Bani Salma mein paidal chal kar meri ayaadat ki. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey paaya jabke main kuchh nahi samajhta tha. To Aap ne paani maanga aur us se wuzu kya, phir mujh par chhidka aur main jaaga. To main ne kaha: Tum mujhey kya hukm detey ho ke main apne maal mein karun Ya Rasulullah? To naazil hui: (Allah tumhey tumhaari aulaad mein wasiyat karta hai). (Bukhari: 4577). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Beshak Allah zarra baraabar zulm nahi karta)."
"1732","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein logon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya ham Qiyaamat key din apne Rab ko dekhengey? To Aap ne rooyat ki hadees zikr ki aur wo poori guzar chuki hai. Phir farmaya: Jab Qiyaamat ka din hoga to pukaarne wala pukaarega: Har ummat uskey peechey chaley jise wo poojti thi. To jo Allah key siwa buton aur nishaanon ko poojta tha baaqi na rahega magar wo aag mein girengey. Yahan tak ke jab sirf wo baaqi rahega jo Allah ko poojta tha, nek ya faasiq, aur Kitaab walon key baaqi. To Yahood bulaaey jaaengey. To un se kaha jaaeyga: Tum kise poojtey they? Wo kahengey: Ham Uzair ko poojtey they jo Allah ka beta hai. To un se kaha jaaeyga: Tum ne jhoot kaha, Allah ne biwi aur beta nahi banaaya. To tum kya chaaahtey ho? To wo kahengey: Ham pyaasey hain ae hamaarey Rab, hamein pila! To ishaara kya jaaeyga: Kya tum paani par nahi aatey? To wo aag ki taraf haankey jaaengey goya wo reet hai jo baaz baaz ko todti hai. To wo aag mein girengey. Phir Nasaara bulaaey jaaengey. To un se kaha jaaeyga: Tum kise poojtey they? Wo kahengey: Ham Maseeh ko poojtey they jo Allah ka beta hai. To un se kaha jaaeyga: Tum ne jhoot kaha, Allah ne biwi aur beta nahi banaaya. To un se kaha jaaeyga: Tum kya chaaahtey ho? To aise hi pehlon jaisa. Yahan tak ke jab sirf wo baaqi rahega jo Allah ko poojta tha, nek ya faasiq. To unkey paas Jahaanon ka Rab us soorat mein aayega jo unhon-ne us mein dekhi thi us se kam. To kaha jaaeyga: Tum kis ka intezaar kartey ho? Har ummat uskey peechey chalti hai jise wo poojti thi. Wo kahengey: Ham ne duniya mein logon se judai ki jab ham unkey sab se mohtaaj they aur ham ne unki sohbat nahi ki. Jabke ham apne Rab ka intezaar kartey hain jise ham poojtey they. To wo farmaaeyga: Main tumhaara Rab hun. To wo kahengey: Ham Allah key sath kuchh shareek nahi kartey. Do ya teen martaba. (Bukhari: 4581). Allah Taala ka qaul: (To kaisa hoga jab ham har ummat mein se gawaah laaein)."
"1733","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Mujh par padho. Main ne kaha: Main tum par padhun jabke tum par naazil hua hai? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main pasand karta hun ke use apne siwa se sunu. To main ne Aap par Surat-un-Nisa padhi yahan tak ke main (To kaisa hoga jab ham har ummat mein se gawaah laaein aur tumhey un par gawaah laaein) tak pahuncha. Aap ne farmaya: Ruko! Phir Aapki donon aankhein beh rahi thein. (Bukhari: 4582). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Beshak jinhey farishtey faut kartey hain jabke wo apni jaanon par zulm karney waley hain)."
"1734","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Musalmaanon mein se log mushrikeen key sath they jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein mushrikeen ki taadaad badhaatey they. Teer aata aur uskey sath phenka jaata aur un mein se kisi ko lagta aur use qatl karta ya maara jaata aur qatl kya jaata. To Allah ne naazil farmaya: (Beshak jinhey farishtey faut kartey hain jabke wo apni jaanon par zulm karney waley hain) aayat. (Bukhari: 4596). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Beshak ham ne tumhaari taraf wahi ki jaisey ham ne Nuh ki taraf wahi ki)."
"1735","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo kahey: Main Yunus bin Matta se behtar hun, us ne jhoot kaha. (Bukhari: 4604). Abu Qilaaba se riwayat hai ke wo Umar bin Abdul Aziz key peechey baitha tha. To unhon-ne zikr kya aur zikr kya. To unhon-ne kaha aur unhon-ne kaha: Khulafa ne uskey sath qisaas diya hai. To wo Abu Qilaaba ki taraf mutawajjeh hua jabke wo uski peeth key peechey tha. To us ne kaha: Ae Abdullah bin Zaid tum kya kehtey ho? Ya kaha: Ae Abu Qilaaba tum kya kehtey ho? Main ne kaha: Main nahi jaanta ke jaan ka qatl Islam mein halaal hua magar aadmi jis ne ehsaan key baad zina kya ya jaan key badley jaan qatl ki ya Allah aur uskey Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ladai ki. To Anbasa ne kaha: Hamein Anas ne aisa aisa bayan kya. Main ne kaha: Mujhey Anas ne bayan kya. Unhon-ne kaha: Qaum Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai aur Aap se baat ki. To unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne is zameen ko mawafiq nahi paaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye hamaarey oont hain jo nikaltey hain. To un mein niklo aur unkey doodhon aur peshaabon mein se piyo. To wo un mein nikley aur unkey peshaabon aur doodhon mein se piya aur tandrust ho gaey. Aur charwaahay par jhukay aur use qatl kya aur oonton ko haank ley gaey. To in se kya der ki jaaeygi? Unhon-ne jaan qatl ki aur Allah aur uskey Rasool se ladai ki aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko daraaya. To us ne kaha: SubhanAllah! To main ne kaha: Tum mujh par tohmat lagaatey ho? Us ne kaha: Hamein iskey sath Anas ne bayan kya. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur kaha: Ae fulaan walon! Beshak tum bhalai mein rahogey jab tak ye tum mein baaqi hai ya us jaisa. (4610). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Allah Taala ka qaul: (Ae Rasool! Pahunchaao jo tumhaari taraf tumharey Rab se naazil hua)."
